      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks for the reply Fax!\n\nI’m trying to add dynamic text sizing for custom headers based on the existing font size of the tmp asset itself. I’m doing this by using <size> tags with a pre-configured value, but I would rather it be a scaled value from the tmp’s font size itself so updating said font size automatically updates the generated headers as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
